# 🏗️ AiBus — Production-Grade Admin Module: Implementation Plan

> **Date:** October 9, 2026  
> **Scope:** Backend Admin Module for AiBus Bus Booking Platform  
> **Based on:** Deep analysis of existing codebase + research of RedBus, AbhiBus, and industry leaders

