### 3.2 API Route Structure

All admin APIs will be mounted under `/api/v1/admin/` with:
- **Authentication:** `authenticate` middleware (mandatory)
- **Authorization:** `authorize('ADMIN', 'SUPER_ADMIN')` middleware (mandatory)
- **Admin Rate Limiting:** Separate, more permissive rate limiter for admin
- **Audit Logging:** Automatic audit trail on every mutation

