## 5. Admin Roles & Permissions

### 5.1 Role Hierarchy (Existing — Enhanced)

| Role | Level | Capabilities |
|---|---|---|
| `CUSTOMER` | 0 | Self-service only |
| `OPERATOR_AGENT` | 1 | View own operator's bookings, limited stats |
| `SUPPORT_AGENT` | 2 | View bookings, users, tickets; resolve support issues |
| `ADMIN` | 3 | Full platform management, cannot manage other admins |
| `SUPER_ADMIN` | 4 | Everything + admin management + system config + dangerous ops |

